From 66fd1174c804fb707d82b6858d495b5af47c6bcb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LuneOS <luneos@webos-ports.org>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 12:58:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] data: add the LuneOS application files

The three files install_luneos needs: the appinfo.json template webOS reads
to know the application exists, the entry point it names, and the
environment file the container service reads.

The entry point only execs a helper the distro ships, because what it has to
do does not belong in this tree: it resolves the compositor's session
environment, initialises Waydroid on first use, and then stays in the
foreground for as long as Android has something on screen, since SAM tracks
a native application by the process it spawned and would otherwise never
consider it running.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [LuneOS specific]
---
 data/configs/environment/waydroid-luneos.env |  2 ++
 data/configs/luneos/appinfo.json             | 11 +++++++++++
 data/scripts/waydroid-luneos.sh              |  2 ++
 3 files changed, 15 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 data/configs/environment/waydroid-luneos.env
 create mode 100644 data/configs/luneos/appinfo.json
 create mode 100755 data/scripts/waydroid-luneos.sh

diff --git a/data/configs/environment/waydroid-luneos.env b/data/configs/environment/waydroid-luneos.env
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..71ab013
--- /dev/null
+++ b/data/configs/environment/waydroid-luneos.env
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+XDG_RUNTIME_DIR=/tmp/luna-session
+XDG_SESSION_TYPE=wayland
diff --git a/data/configs/luneos/appinfo.json b/data/configs/luneos/appinfo.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..32c8544
--- /dev/null
+++ b/data/configs/luneos/appinfo.json
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+{
+    "id": "Waydroid",
+    "title": "Waydroid",
+    "version": "__VERSION__",
+    "main": "waydroid.sh",
+    "params": "",
+    "type": "native",
+    "uiRevision": 2,
+    "vendorurl": "https://waydro.id",
+    "icon": "icon.png"
+}
diff --git a/data/scripts/waydroid-luneos.sh b/data/scripts/waydroid-luneos.sh
new file mode 100755
index 0000000..5a30563
--- /dev/null
+++ b/data/scripts/waydroid-luneos.sh
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+#!/bin/sh
+exec /usr/libexec/waydroid-luneos-app
-- 
